  "comments": "<p>UV activity:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d1dba0cd61d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d1dba0cd61d.jpg\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d1dbaaa87df.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d1dbaaa87df.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Security thread - only visible when the banknote is placed under a backlight, inscription “PERU 10 BCRP” repeated throughout:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d27845b8330.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d27845b8330.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Denomination “10” at left-centre on obverse side printed in colour-shifting ink - switching colours between purple and gold:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d1dc3a5eb3d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d1dc3a5eb3d.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66d1dc3d5dd8f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66d1dc3d5dd8f.jpg\"></a></p><p>© Kiet Tran<br>When tilted, on the shoulder of Gonzáles “10” is revealed:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6952db37bbdc2.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6952db37bbdc2.webp\"></a><br>@ByRussia45</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Reform of the name of the monetary unit to \"SOLES\", removing the word \"NUEVOS\" (new)</p>",
